    "SIM lineage: 60-station synthetic truth bed (runs/simnet60_quiet_wu93_24h), GPS L1/L2/L5 + Galileo E1/E5a/E5b, W6 satellite code bias + geometry-free datum, FREE per-LOS slant iono (posture C, no SH), phase_leveling carry (NOT carry_invariant) with the F3 station-wide whitened local block, r2q3 clock anchor, sticky pivot, relevel_free_epoch, the standard QC/observability set.  Validated: SPEC_synthetic_minimum_network §18, SPEC_amb_iono_split_overcount §6.8.",
    "pins: {\"network.phase_leveling_local_block\": true, \"network.phase_datum_handover_max_var_m2\": 0.01, \"network.disc_threshold_frac_cycles\": 0.25, \"network.parallel_seam\": true, \"network.trace_section_timers\": true, \"network.station_pd_pin_aware\": true, \"network.phase_datum_min_stations\": 2, \"network.cb_kaula_prior\": true, \"network.cb_kaula_sigma_m\": 3.0, \"network.sbasis_complete\": true, \"network.code_datum_time_linked\": true, \"network.cycle_slip.if_phase_td_ref_gate\": true, \"network.exclude_unmodeled_antenna_stations\": true, \"network.parallel_max_threads\": 20, \"network.trace_phase_anchor\": true, \"network.readmit_seed_horizon_s\": 3900.0}",
    "exceptions (deliberately unarmed ledger recommendations): {\"network.carry_invariant\": \"mutually exclusive VEHICLE: this lineage carries ambiguities through the phase-leveling F3 block (SPEC_amb_iono_split_overcount); carry_invariant would make F3 inert (do_amb_carry) — the ledger regime now excludes F1/F3 lineages\", \"network.carry_invariant_pd_safe\": \"inert without carry_invariant (same vehicle exclusion)\", \"network.estimate_iono_sh\": \"posture C by design: the sim bed grades the FREE per-LOS slant ionosphere against truth (SPEC_synthetic_minimum_network §13, 'NO ionosphere constraint by design'); the SH layer is the FIELD posture (see golden_field_gps_dual)\", \"network.clock_datum_sum_to_zero\": \"does NOT graduate (ledger row: 12 h A/B excursion-suppressing but higher steady median; the pin datum stays); also INERT-izes sticky_pivot\", \"network.emit_pb_filter_gate_v2\": \"out of regime (needs carry_invariant + emit_pb_filter)\"}",
